#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_CantMakeHeadsOrTails"
msgid ""
"Umm… If this goes here, and that\n"
"goes over there…\p"
"Then where does this thing go?\n"
"And what about that doohickey?\p"
"Aaargh! I can't make heads or tails\n"
"of this!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……如果这个放这里，那个放那边……\p"
"那这个东西放哪里呢？\n"
"还有那个玩意儿呢？\p"
"啊啊啊！我完全搞不明白！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:73
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_MeetDockDeliverToStern"
msgid ""
"Hm?\n"
"Hi, I'm DOCK.\p"
"CAPT. STERN commissioned me to\n"
"design a ferry.\p"
"Oh! That there…\n"
"Are they DEVON GOODS?\p"
"But, hmm…\n"
"This won't do…\p"
"CAPT. STERN went off somewhere.\n"
"He said he had some work to do.\p"
"Could I get you to go find CAPT.\n"
"STERN and deliver that to him?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你好，我叫铁杉。\p"
"楠木船长委托我设计一艘渡轮。\p"
"哦！那个……那是得文的物品吗？\p"
"不过，嗯……这可不行……\p"
"楠木船长到别的地方去了。\n"
"他说他有些工作要做。\p"
"能请你去找楠木船长，把那个交给他吗？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_CouldYouFindStern"
msgid ""
"DOCK: Where could CAPT. STERN have\n"
"gone off to?\p"
"Could you go find CAPT. STERN and\n"
"deliver that parcel to him?$"
msgstr ""
"铁杉：楠木船长会跑到哪里去了呢？\p"
"能请你去找楠木船长，\n"
"把那个包裹交给他吗？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:93
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_CouldUseAdviceFromVeteran"
msgid ""
"DOCK: Shipbuilding is an art.\p"
"A lot of things can't be figured out\n"
"just by calculating.\p"
"I really could use advice from a veteran\n"
"who knows the seas…$"
msgstr ""
"铁杉：造船是一门艺术。\p"
"有很多事情光靠计算是搞不清楚的。\p"
"我真希望能得到一位熟悉大海的\n"
"老手的建议……$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:100
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_BrineyJoinedUs"
msgid ""
"DOCK: Hi! MR. BRINEY's joined us to\n"
"lend us his help.\p"
"Thanks to the veteran sailor, the\n"
"ferry is steadily coming together.$"
msgstr ""
"铁杉：你好！哈奇老人来帮我们的忙了。\p"
"多亏了这位老水手，\n"
"渡轮的建造进展得很顺利。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:106
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_FerryIsReady"
msgid ""
"DOCK: The ferry is finally ready!\p"
"The new S.S. TIDAL is truly a marvel\n"
"of technology!\p"
"But, I get the feeling that we can\n"
"make something even better.\p"
"You know, there's never an end to\n"
"technology's march.$"
msgstr ""
"铁杉：渡轮终于完工了！\p"
"新的潮汐号真是科技的奇迹！\p"
"不过，我总觉得我们还\n"
"能造出更好的东西。\p"
"你知道吗，科技的进步是永无止境的。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:115
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_DecidedToHelpDock"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"It's been too long!\p"
"Aye, since I met you, this old sea dog's\n"
"been feeling frisky!\p"
"So I've decided to help DOCK make\n"
"a ferry.\p"
"Aye, after all, a ferry would be able\n"
"to carry a lot of people.\p"
"But, you know, that DOCK is really\n"
"something special.\p"
"With his knack for technology and\n"
"my experience, I'm sure that we can\l"
"build one great ship, aye!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}！好久不见了！\p"
"是啊，自从遇见你以后，\n"
"我这个老水手就变得精神抖擞了！\p"
"所以我决定帮铁杉建造渡轮。\p"
"是啊，毕竟渡轮能载很多人嘛。\p"
"不过，你知道吗，\n"
"那个铁杉真的很了不起。\p"
"凭他的技术天分和我的经验，我们一\n"
"定能造出一艘了不起的船，没错！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_SeaIsLikeLivingThing"
msgid ""
"The seasons, the weather, where\n"
"the moon sits in the sky…\p"
"These and other conditions make\n"
"the sea change its expression.\p"
"That's right!\n"
"The sea is like a living thing!$"
msgstr ""
"季节、天气、月亮在天空中的位置……\p"
"这些条件都会让大海改变它的样貌。\p"
"没错！大海就像是活着的生物！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F/scripts.inc:138
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_GetSeasickEasily"
msgid ""
"I get seasick real easily.\n"
"So I get to help out here instead.$"
msgstr ""
"我很容易晕船。\n"
"所以就改成在这里帮忙了。$"
